      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Standardizes the spec reviewer's checks into categories (completeness, coverage, consistency, clarity, YAGNI) with a critical list for TODO/placeholder text and an approved/issues-found output format, so every spec gets the same dispatch via the general-purpose Task tool."
    },
